	(descr "SOT23-6L with the land pattern Littelfuse recommends for the SP3019 / SP3012-04HTG: pads 0.60 x 0.85, 0.95 pitch, 3.33 overall (hardware/datasheets/SP3019_littelfuse_rev2018-01-25.pdf page 5, Recommended soldering pad layout). The KiCad SOT-23-6 pads are 1.325 long and leave a 0.95 channel between the two pad rows; this one leaves 1.63 mm, which two 90 ohm lines need to pass between the rows.")
